1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:12,040
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,080
=Episode 1=

3
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:22,160
(SWAN LAKE
Luo Xiyu, Principal Dancer)

4
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,440
(Will you marry me?)

5
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,080
(Who is he?)

6
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,720
(Why does he keep showing up
in my dreams?)

7
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:59,100
(And every time he does, something
dangerous and unexpected happens.)

8
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,000
(Where did he go?)

9
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,280
(I have to find him
and get some answers.)

10
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,760
(What the hell is going on?)

11
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,960
(SWAN LAKE)

12
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,000
Hey!

13
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:05,800
(Pei A 36649)

14
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,840
(Dear passengers,)

15
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,760
(the next stop is Dongting Lake Station.)

16
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:35,000
(Passengers getting off, please...)

17
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,520
(Where am I?)

18
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,160
(Wasn't I)

19
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,400
(outside the theater?)

20
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,000
(How did I end up on a bus?)

21
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,120
(And why am I in my school uniform?)

22
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:52,280
(October 2014...)

23
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:56,440
(October 11, 2014)

24
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,040
2014?

25
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,560
(07:03, Saturday, October 11, 2014
Lunar Calendar: September 18)

26
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,860
(It really is 2014.)

27
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,520
I've time-traveled?

28
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,720
(Luo Xiyu, A high School Senior)
(Why did I come back to my worst days?)

29
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,600
(Luo Xiyu, A high School Senior)
(I was already a principal dancer.)

30
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,600
(Now I have to start all over again?)

31
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,200
(What the hell is going on?)

32
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,120
(We've arrived at Dongting Lake Station.)

33
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,440
(Passengers, please move further
inside to make room for others.)

34
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,600
(It's him.)

35
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,200
(Did he travel back in time too?)

36
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,120
(No, that can't be.)

37
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,120
(I was the only one who died.)

38
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,360
(He was perfectly fine.)

39
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:43,920
Hey!

40
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:46,720
It's me.

41
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,960
It's me!

42
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,320
In 2025,

43
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,080
I'd just finished my performance.

44
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,160
I ran out after you,

45
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,640
and then I got hit by a car...

46
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,360
(Spoilers...)

47
00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,560
(get locked up.)

48
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:01,480
Who...

49
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:02,600
are you?

50
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,840
(How many times has this happened?)

51
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,520
(You still haven't accepted your fate?)

52
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,400
(You two are destined to clash.)

53
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,120
(The moment either
of you falls in love,)

54
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,880
(there's no escaping
your intertwined fate.)

55
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:22,160
(The next stop is No. 8 High School.)

56
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,280
(Ten years...)

57
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:27,440
(Ten years before 2025
would put me in my senior year.)

58
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,200
(That's now.)

59
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,520
(Is this when we first met?)

60
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,080
(When that voice said "you two",)

61
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,320
(it meant him and me?)

62
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,160
(So this is where our ill-fated
bond began.)

63
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,320
(I'm back before we ever got involved.)

64
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,680
(If everything happens the same way,)

65
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,160
(he's definitely going to fall for me)

66
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,120
(and try to get close to me.)

67
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,560
(And then)

68
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,000
(I'll...)

69
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,720
(What were those dreams
warning me about?)

70
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,960
(I'm going to die?)

71
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,400
(No way.)

72
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,560
(I have to stop this
before it even starts.)

73
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,240
(I won't have anything to do with him.)

74
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,640
Wait a second!

75
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:06,000
Ugh!

76
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:25,280
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

77
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:28,600
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

78
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:33,720
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

79
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:39,240
♪I swallowed every lie♪

80
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:42,360
♪And forgot how cold you became♪

81
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,120
(Is she...)

82
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,880
(the girl who gave me that cake?)

83
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:48,040
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

84
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,380
♪I still ended up completely defeated♪

85
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,200
(Academic Building)

86
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,440
But the dance exam is coming up.

87
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,440
(This is my best friend, Xiaoba.)

88
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,280
(Xiaoba, Luo Xiyu's Best Friend)
What if you don't get in?

89
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:56,840
(Xiaoba, Luo Xiyu's Best Friend)
(Right now,)

90
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,040
(she's helping me reload
my old memories.)

91
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,877
(Quiet Upon Entry)
(Basically, I grew up)

92
00:06:00,878 --> 00:06:02,120
(Study Once Seated)
(in a single-parent family.)

93
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,560
(Focus on Your Studies)
(But my mom loves me very much.)

94
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,240
(I've only ever had one sworn rival.)

95
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,440
(Her name is Song Shuqi.)

96
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,960
(She's always trying to one-up me.)

97
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,640
(She even pushed me down the stairs.)

98
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,160
But with my foot like this...

99
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,800
can I still dance?

100
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:17,120
Even if you give up dancing,

101
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,320
with your grades,

102
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,360
if you work a little harder,

103
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,880
you could get into Tsinghua
or Peking University.

104
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,280
Your mom doesn't want you
going to the Dance Academy anyway.

105
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,040
But I don't want to go to
either of those.

106
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,000
I just want to go to the Dance Academy.

107
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,120
You got this!

108
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,480
A broken leg gets her
out of cleaning duty now?

109
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,880
Somebody here

110
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,400
just love playing the helpless victim.

111
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,920
Song Shuqi!

112
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,160
It's been this long,
and you still haven't apologized.

113
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:41,880
And now you're mocking her?

114
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:42,800
What is wrong with you?

115
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,240
(Song Shuqi, Luo Xiyu's Rival)
Are you nuts?

116
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,520
(Song Shuqi, Luo Xiyu's Rival)
There were tons of people on the stairs.

117
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:47,680
She twisted her ankle herself

118
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,320
and fell.

119
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,320
We were walking together.

120
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,600
I know she didn't fall!

121
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,160
You're so fat,

122
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,760
maybe you're the one
who knocked her down.

123
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,080
And you have the nerve to blame me?

124
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:58,520
You're just jealous
because Xiyu dances better than you.

125
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,680
You're scared she'll get into
the Dance Academy

126
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,560
and you won't!

127
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,560
What did you just say?

128
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,400
I dare you, say that again!

129
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,240
You think I wouldn't dare?

130
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,840
Xiaoba!

131
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,040
Stop it, both of you.

132
00:07:06,525 --> 00:07:07,360
Xiaoba, calm down.

133
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,400
Don't let this get you written up.
She's not worth it.

134
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,360
Whatever.

135
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,320
Xiyu,

136
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,440
hurry up and get better.

137
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,120
Get into the Dance Academy

138
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,880
and make her eat her words.

139
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,680
(Easy for you to say.)

140
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,760
(I'm not confident at all.)

141
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,480
(This body)

142
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,240
(hasn't had those ten years
of training yet.)

143
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:29,120
(In both technique and knowledge,)

144
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,960
(I'm just a high school senior
preparing for a dance exam.)

145
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,000
(And my foot is injured.)

146
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,480
(Don't tell me)

147
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,360
(I have to go through
that entire journey)

148
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,760
(to become a principal dancer
all over again?)

149
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,360
Everyone,

150
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,640
we have a new student joining our class.

151
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,040
Could you introduce yourself?

152
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,440
Hi, everyone.

153
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,400
(He Lan, Senior Transfer Student)
I'm He Lan.

154
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:55,080
(He Lan, Senior Transfer Student)
Let's give him a warm welcome.

155
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,360
Today

156
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:02,000
is our first mock exam of senior year.

157
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,840
So stay focused

158
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,520
and do your best.

159
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,360
Hey, handsome.

160
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,480
(Fan Dongdong, Luo Xiyu's Friend)
Hey there, handsome.

161
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,400
I'm Fan Dongdong.

162
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,480
Everyone calls me Fan.

163
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:23,880
We...

164
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,840
We meet again.

165
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,400
(Very well.)

166
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,840
(Keep it up.)

167
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,040
(Just keep ignoring me.)

168
00:08:34,012 --> 00:08:36,320
(Today's Special
Signature Strawberry Cake: 20 Yuan Each)

169
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,160
It's really good.

170
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:39,480
Yeah.

171
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,920
I don't like owing people.

172
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,240
Seriously? What's wrong with you?

173
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,680
Guess that's a no.

174
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,120
Do you think he likes you?

175
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,920
For twenty yuan?

176
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,360
He's not my type anyway.

177
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,240
Then what's your type?

178
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:01,560
Well...

179
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:05,520
(Zhang Jinghang, Senior Class Monitor)

180
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:07,800
Hmm...

181
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,120
Sunny,

182
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:09,680
outgoing,

183
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,320
accomplished,

184
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,040
gentlemanly,

185
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:11,760
and warm.

186
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,800
Specific enough?

187
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,440
It's sour.

188
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,280
(Step 1: Rehabilitate my leg.
Step 2: Pre-exam training.)

189
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:26,000
(Step 3: Get into the Dance Academy.
Step 4: Join the Ballet Company.)

190
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,760
(Step 5: Become a principal dancer.)

191
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,120
I'll take one step at a time.

192
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,400
Xiyu.

193
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,320
The scores are out.

194
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,120
Guess who came in first.

195
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,040
He Lan.

196
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,360
He actually beat both you
and Zhang Jinghang.

197
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,120
He got full marks in everything
except the essay.

198
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,240
He blew everyone else out of the water.

199
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,800
You don't think he cheated, do you?

200
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,960
Who could he possibly copy from
and still score that high?

201
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,720
Right.

202
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,240
Good point.

203
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,880
I also heard

204
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,160
He Lan beat someone so badly
they ended up in the hospital.

205
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,080
His old school expelled him.

206
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,760
Our school only took him

207
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,000
because they needed his grades.

208
00:09:59,520 --> 00:09:59,960
I see.

209
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:03,440
Hey,

210
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:03,920
buddy.

211
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,120
Not bad.

212
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,120
Next exam,

213
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,360
do me a favor, will you?

214
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,080
(Ding Jie, Senior Student)
Hey,

215
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,640
I'm talking to you!

216
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:23,520
Ouch!

217
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,640
Okay, okay! My bad!

218
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,520
Ouch! That hurts!

219
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,040
My bad! My bad!

220
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,000
Buddy!

221
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,840
Hey! Easy!

222
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,960
Don't! Please!

223
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:33,760
You okay?

224
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,080
New guy,

225
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,280
you'll be sorry for this.

226
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:41,240
Dude...

227
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,440
that was so cool.

228
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,640
He's handsome,

229
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,320
and smart.

230
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,280
Even I'm falling for him.

231
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,520
(He must think he's so cool right now.)

232
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,040
(Nothing good ever happens)

233
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,520
(when I get too close to him.)

234
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,960
(I need to stay away from him.)

235
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,480
Hey,

236
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,000
where are you going?

237
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:57,480
Huh?

238
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,120
Hey,

239
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,000
what am I supposed to do without you?

240
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:03,640
Hey,

241
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,200
can we switch seats?

242
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:05,600
Sure.

243
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,000
Luo Xiyu,

244
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,000
what's going on?

245
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,360
He Lan is distracting me
from my studies.

246
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,320
It's because...

247
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:15,880
He Lan,

248
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:16,840
come outside with me.

249
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,520
(Class dismissed.)

250
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:37,880
(Want to go play basketball?)

251
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:38,760
(Sure. Let's go.)

252
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:39,440
(I didn't bring the book.)

253
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:39,880
(Hold on.)

254
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,000
(I haven't even had a chance
to review it.)

255
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,840
(I'll do that tonight.)

256
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,400
How exactly was I distracting you?

257
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,200
You just got here and you've already
caused a scene.

258
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,600
How is that not distracting?

259
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,720
You saw what happened.

260
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,200
Ding Jie started it.

261
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,400
It had nothing to do with me.

262
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,280
And what does that have to do with me?

263
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,000
You still disrupted my studying.

264
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,560
You got good grades,

265
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:13,520
but you're terrible.

266
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,600
Doesn't work for me.

267
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,480
(Ugh, I'm so sleepy.)

268
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:24,280
(I guess I'm still not used
to this body.)

269
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:28,120
(I can't do PE anyway.)

270
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,280
(Might as well take a nap.)

271
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:31,280
Hey,

272
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,080
new guy.

273
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,920
I hurt my hand.

274
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:34,760
Help me

275
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,480
collect the balls later, will you?

276
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,960
You're sure they're both in there?

277
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:56,760
Rest assured.

278
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:58,360
Hey!

279
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,440
What are you doing?

280
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,200
There's no way

281
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:06,720
Zhang Jinghang will still think
Luo Xiyu is some innocent little angel

282
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,800
after she spends the night
with that violent punk.

283
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,040
You two really have

284
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,200
a complicated relationship.

285
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:14,160
What's complicated is whatever's going
on between Luo Xiyu and the new guy.

286
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,480
I'm just playing matchmaker.

287
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:16,880
They should be thanking me.

288
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:19,520
Just wait for the show tomorrow.

289
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,300
♪I thought♪

290
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:43,160
♪If we stayed apart a little longer♪

291
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:45,580
♪We'd each find our way♪

292
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:47,380
♪Into a brand-new world♪

293
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,900
♪But somehow, every time♪

294
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:51,740
♪I meet you again♪

295
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,480
♪And every reunion becomes♪

296
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:56,040
♪Another way of letting go♪

297
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,460
♪The promises♪

298
00:13:57,460 --> 00:14:00,320
♪We couldn't keep in this life♪

299
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,440
♪Why should♪

300
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:04,380
♪We leave them for another life
to fulfill♪

301
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:07,120
♪But every time I leave you♪

302
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,920
♪There's always something left unsaid♪

303
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:12,240
♪Farther, farther, farther away♪

304
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:16,900
♪Only to end up by your side again♪

305
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:18,811
♪I still can't let you go♪

306
00:14:18,812 --> 00:14:21,360
♪I still can't let you go♪

307
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:25,560
♪Yet you won't let us love this way♪

308
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,600
♪If we can never be together♪

309
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,680
♪If you don't want me to get hurt♪

310
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,320
♪Then why did you walk♪

311
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:34,160
♪Into this endless future of mine♪

312
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:36,011
♪I still can't let you go♪

313
00:14:36,012 --> 00:14:38,480
♪I still can't let you go♪

314
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:42,640
♪Yet you won't let us love this way♪

315
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,680
♪If we can never be together♪

316
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,800
♪If you don't want me to get hurt♪

317
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:50,840
♪Then why push away the moonlight♪

318
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:54,560
♪And pull me into your arms♪

319
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:14,200
♪The promises♪

320
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:17,200
♪We couldn't keep in this life♪

321
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,500
♪Why should♪

322
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,300
♪We leave them for another life
to fulfill♪
